:: MP NPC Lin More2 Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20 }>><</if>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
守夜岗棚的防风灯拧在最小一档，<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>把值班簿翻到夹着铅笔条的副页。他说三街区入夜后的琐事单凭一趟巡逻走不完，得按钟点分成三摞：前半夜的捞钥匙、修更梆与补桥坑归在前一页，后半夜的搬柴棚与系船缆归在次一页，旧车库、东口早市与寒夜火盆节则另记在休班页上。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前页 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[看前半夜琐务 (0:03)|MP NPC Lin Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[翻后半夜巡务页 (0:03)|MP NPC Lin Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[查看同行与火盆节 (0:03)|MP NPC Lin Date More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Lin Daily More Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20 }>><</if>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
前半夜的值班簿记着三桩街坊急事。多姆斯街洗衣巷口的排水沟<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyLin10>>已经帮夜班女工捞回了门钥匙<<else>>掉进了女工的门钥匙，铁箅子还半掀着<</if>>；老周的更夫棚里<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyLin11>>裂开的木梆已经用铜丝箍紧<<else>>硬木梆子裂了一道缝，半夜报时声发闷<</if>>；高街石桥南口<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyLin12>>压碎的铺路石坑已经填平<<else>>被送奶车压出大坑，凌晨返程容易翻车<</if>>。<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>提着风灯等你挑一处先去。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回副页 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[去沟口捞钥匙 (0:04)|MP NPC Lin Daily 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[前去更夫棚修梆 (0:04)|MP NPC Lin Daily 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[到石桥南口填路坑 (0:05)|MP NPC Lin Daily 12]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Lin Daily More2 Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20 }>><</if>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
后半夜的巡务页记着零点以后的两处隐患。面包房后巷的半顶柴棚<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyLin13>>已经把干柴挪进里侧并压好油布<<else>>被急雨灌湿了外侧，不趁夜挪进去会耽误明早四点引火<</if>>；旧港内河码头的小渔船<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyLin14>>已经重打双套结系稳在石桩上<<else>>主缆磨出了毛边，两点涨潮时随时会断缆漂走<</if>>。<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>紧了紧风衣领口，问你先走哪一头。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回值班副页 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[去后巷护干柴 (0:04)|MP NPC Lin Daily 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<mpropeicon>><<link [[去内河岸重系船缆 (0:05)|MP NPC Lin Daily 14]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Lin Date More Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20 }>><</if>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _linYearNow to (Time.date.year or 0)>>
值班簿末页记着两趟长钟点的同行与冬月桥头火盆节。宅邸街旧修车库<<if $daily.mpNpcDateLin5>>今夜已经帮老邵翻修完车轴<<else>>还亮着煤油灯，等着在五点交车前修好板车轴<</if>>；高街东口早市<<if $daily.mpNpcDateLin6>>今晨已经帮摊主收过摊<<else>>在破晓五点四十收摊，得赶在洒水车来前搭把手<</if>>。至于冬夜的桥头火盆节，<<if (_lin.festivalYear or 0) is _linYearNow>>今年的火盆已经收拢入库<<elseif Time.season is "winter">>眼下正是搬铁盆守夜的日子<<else>>要等入冬霜降后才会重开<</if>>。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总目 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[动身去旧车库 (0:04)|MP NPC Lin Date 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[前往高街东早市 (0:04)|MP NPC Lin Date 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<if (_lin.hasMet or 0) and Time.season is "winter" and (_lin.festivalYear or 0) isnot _linYearNow>>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[翻看桥头火盆节簿 (0:05)|MP NPC Lin Festival Prep]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<elseif (_lin.festivalYear or 0) is _linYearNow>>
今年火盆已经收拢入库，桥栏只剩一圈灰印。
<<elseif not (_lin.hasMet or 0)>>
守夜人的节簿还压在岗棚抽屉里。
<<else>>
火盆节要等入冬霜降后才会重开。
<</if>>
:: MP NPC Lin Daily 10 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20 }>><</if>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
二十二点十分的多姆斯街洗衣巷口，雨刚停，排水沟的铁箅子斜靠在砖墙边。穿灰工装的夜班女工冻得指节通红，她的家门钥匙顺着雨水滑进了沟底淤泥。<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>取下腰间铁钩与防风灯，沟口窄得只容一人探臂。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyLin10>>沾泥的铜钥匙已经捞上来擦净交还，铁箅子也严严实实盖回了原位。<<else>>女工急得直搓手，等你们搭把手。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回前半夜页 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[探手下沟捞钥 (0:10)|MP NPC Lin Daily 10 After]]>><<pass 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActLin10 to 1>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 220 or (_lin.trust or 0) gte 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkLin10 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkLin10 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[提亮风灯照清沟底 (0:08)|MP NPC Lin Daily 10 After]]>><<pass 8>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActLin10 to 2>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 220 or ($willpower or 0) gte 220>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkLin10 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkLin10 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Lin Daily 11 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20 }>><</if>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
二十三点整，多姆斯街更夫棚里的老周咳得直不起腰，手里的硬木梆子从口沿裂到了绳孔，敲起来闷哑无声。<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>接过木梆看了看纹路，从工具袋里摸出细铜丝与蜂蜡。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyLin11>>裂开的木梆已经用铜丝箍紧封蜡，三更的梆声重新清亮地传遍巷子。<<else>>要么替老周先把这一更敲完，要么趁热把木梆裂缝箍紧。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回前半夜页 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[替老周走一更 (0:12)|MP NPC Lin Daily 11 After]]>><<pass 12>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActLin11 to 1>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 230 or ($tending or 0) gte 230>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkLin11 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkLin11 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[缠上铜丝箍紧裂梆 (0:10)|MP NPC Lin Daily 11 After]]>><<pass 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActLin11 to 2>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 240>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkLin11 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkLin11 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Lin Daily 12 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20 }>><</if>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
二十三点四十分，高街石桥南口的一块青石板被重载送奶车压碎，塌出一个脸盆大的泥坑，周围碎石全松了。<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>蹲在坑边量了量深浅，说凌晨四点送奶车原路返回时天色最黑，车轮一陷进去准会掀翻整车奶桶。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyLin12>>石桥南口的陷坑已经用备用方砖与碎石垫平夯实。<<else>>桥墩下正好堆着几块修路剩的方砖。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回前半夜页 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[去搬砖填桥坑 (0:14)|MP NPC Lin Daily 12 After]]>><<pass 14>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActLin12 to 1>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 235>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkLin12 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkLin12 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[在坑旁立灯桩示警 (0:10)|MP NPC Lin Daily 12 After]]>><<pass 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActLin12 to 2>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 220>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkLin12 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkLin12 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Lin Daily 13 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20 }>><</if>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
零点二十分，面包房后巷的半顶柴棚被斜风急雨灌湿了外侧一排。明早四点第一炉面包的引火全指望里侧那几捆干松柴。<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>把风灯挂上棚柱，说趁雨势暂歇把干柴往里倒腾一层、再扯过帆布压紧砖头，就能保住明早的炉火。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyLin13>>干柴已经整整齐齐码在里侧，帆布四角也压稳了青砖。<<else>>巷风湿冷，两人搭手最快。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回后半夜页 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[去搬柴进内棚 (0:12)|MP NPC Lin Daily 13 After]]>><<pass 12>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActLin13 to 1>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 235>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkLin13 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkLin13 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[拉过帆布压紧砖角 (0:10)|MP NPC Lin Daily 13 After]]>><<pass 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActLin13 to 2>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 230 or ($athletics or 0) gte 230>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkLin13 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkLin13 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Lin Daily 14 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20 }>><</if>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
凌晨一点十分，旧港内河码头的潮水开始往上涨。船主在医院陪床，托<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>照看的那条小渔船正随着暗流撞击石桩，主缆在桩口磨断了三股麻线。两点整大潮一顶，单股残缆肯定绷不住。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyLin14>>小渔船已经换上副缆并贴岸系牢，任凭潮水涨落也纹丝不动。<<else>>他从桩旁解下备用副缆，让你帮着稳住船头。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回后半夜页 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpropeicon>><<link [[重打双套结系桩 (0:12)|MP NPC Lin Daily 14 After]]>><<pass 12>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActLin14 to 1>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 220 or ($tending or 0) gte 230>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkLin14 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkLin14 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[拽住船头拉近石岸 (0:14)|MP NPC Lin Daily 14 After]]>><<pass 14>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActLin14 to 2>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 235>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkLin14 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkLin14 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Lin Daily 10 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, trustManor: 20, trustDomus: 20, trustHigh: 20, watch: 20, law: 0, clues: 0, caseStage: 0 }>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.lin.trustManor is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustManor to 20>><</if>><<if $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus to 20>><</if>><<if $mpNpcs.lin.trustHigh is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustHigh to 20>><</if>><<if $mpNpcs.lin.watch is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.watch to 20>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.lin.law is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.law to 0>><</if>><<if $mpNpcs.lin.clues is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.clues to 0>><</if>><<if $mpNpcs.lin.caseStage is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.caseStage to 0>><</if>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _act to ($daily.mpNpcDailyActLin10 or 1)>>
<<set _ok to ($daily.mpNpcDailyOkLin10 or 0)>>
洗衣巷口的积水映着岗棚灯，<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>蹲在沟沿挪开铁箅子。<<if _act is 1>>你挽袖探臂进冷泥，指节一寸寸摸过沟底。<<if _ok>>终于勾住铜环，女工接过钥匙连声道谢，说今夜能睡个整觉；<<else>>可捞了两回只摸到碎瓦，最后还是他换弯钩才带出钥匙，女工道谢时声音发虚；<</if>>巷口几扇窗推开一条缝。<<else>>你举高风灯斜照沟底，铜齿泛出一点亮。<<if _ok>>他顺光落钩一下带出钥匙，女工硬塞来半块热红薯；<<else>>灯罩被水汽糊白，光柱晃两晃便散，钩子空捞半晌仍没勾住钥匙环，最后只能借来长钳，女工冻红的手搓了又搓；<</if>>铁箅子扣回原位。<</if>>
<<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyLin10>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDailyLin10 to 1>>
<<set _lin.trust to Math.min(100, (_lin.trust or 0) + 1)>>
<<if _ok>><<set _lin.trustDomus to Math.min(100, (_lin.trustDomus or 20) + 1)>><<set _lin.love to Math.min(100, (_lin.love or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回日常页 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一件事 (0:03)|MP NPC Lin Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

