<<walkicon>><<link [[踏着晨光回岗棚 (0:04)|MP NPC Lin More2 Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Lin Festival Prep [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20 }>><</if>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<if _lin.trustDomus is undefined>><<set _lin.trustDomus to 20>><</if>>
<<if _lin.watch is undefined>><<set _lin.watch to 20>><</if>>
冬月寒潮落定前，多姆斯街石桥头要支起守夜火盆，替晚归的苦力与巡夜人留一口热气，也顺带祭一祭三年前坠渠的老霍克。<<if (_lin.watch or 0) gte 60>>街坊们早早送来了耐烧的硬木炭，<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>把老霍克的旧铜牌交给你擦拭。<<elseif (_lin.watch or 0) gte 30>>几户熟识的铺面捎来干柴，他让你搭手把生铁火盆抬上桥头。<<else>>夜里街面冷清，全靠你们两人把火盆与炭火备齐。<</if>>

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[去备节前物料 (0:10)|MP NPC Lin Festival]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.festivalPrep to "ready">><<set $mpNpcs.lin.festivalPrepYear to (Time.date.year or 0)>><<stress -2>><</link>>
:: MP NPC Lin Festival [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20 }>><</if>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
桥头生铁盆里的炭火烧得通红，雪粒落在盆沿滋滋化作白汽。<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>把老霍克那枚缺角的铜牌摆在石栏上，说守火盆的规矩不讲排场：带一壶烈酒温热身子、采一束耐寒的白菊压在牌下，或是约几个街坊一起围火守夜，都算全了这份心意。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if ($money or 0) gte 120>>
<<mpdrinkicon>><<link [[温一壶高粱酒 (0:12)|MP NPC Lin Festival Resolve]]>><<pass 12>><<money -120>><<set $daily.mpNpcLinFestPick to "wine">><</link>><br>
<<else>>
<span class="disabled">温一壶高粱酒 (0:12)（囊中羞涩）</span><br>
<</if>>
<<mpherbicon>><<link [[去采一束白菊花 (0:10)|MP NPC Lin Festival Resolve]]>><<pass 10>><<tiredness 2>><<set $daily.mpNpcLinFestPick to "flower">><</link>><br>
<<mphandshakeicon>><<link [[招呼街坊围炉守夜 (0:16)|MP NPC Lin Festival Resolve]]>><<pass 16>><<tiredness 2>><<set $daily.mpNpcLinFestPick to "people">><</link>>

:: MP NPC Lin Festival Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20 }>><</if>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _yearNow to (Time.date.year or 0)>>
<<set _first to ((_lin.festivalYear or 0) isnot _yearNow)>>
<<set _pick to ($daily.mpNpcLinFestPick or "flower")>>
<<set _prepOk to ((_lin.festivalPrepYear or 0) is _yearNow and (_lin.festivalPrep or "none") is "ready")>>
<<set _w to ((_lin.watch or 20) + (_prepOk ? 10 : 0))>>
<<set _ok to ((_pick is "wine" and (_w gte 35 or ($english or 0) gte 220)) or (_pick is "flower" and (_w gte 25 or ($tending or 0) gte 200)) or (_pick is "people" and _w gte 45))>>
<<set _mid to (_w gte 20)>>
<<set _res to (_ok ? "success" : (_mid ? "partial" : "fail"))>>
炭火在夜风里噼啪跳动，<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>接过你备好的心意摆在石栏前。<<if _ok>>火盆整夜未熄，晚归的车夫与更夫纷纷停下烤火，他望着跃动的红光，终于把压在心底三年的愧疚缓缓吐出一口气。<<set _lin.festivalResult to "success">><<if _first>><<set _lin.trustDomus to Math.min(100, (_lin.trustDomus or 0) + 6)>><<set _lin.watch to Math.min(100, (_lin.watch or 20) + 5)>><<money 150>><<stress -4>><<set _lin.festivalYear to _yearNow>><</if>><<elseif _mid>>后半夜雪势转急，火苗虽被压低，你们还是轮流添炭撑到了早班交接。<<set _lin.festivalResult to "partial">><<if _first>><<set _lin.trustDomus to Math.min(100, (_lin.trustDomus or 0) + 2)>><<set _lin.watch to Math.min(100, (_lin.watch or 20) + 2)>><<stress -1>><<set _lin.festivalYear to _yearNow>><</if>><<else>>湿雪灌进火盆压灭了炭心，桥头冷风刺骨，聚不起半点人气，也没拿到半分津贴。<<set _lin.festivalResult to "fail">><<if _first>><<set _lin.watch to Math.max(0, (_lin.watch or 20) - 3)>><<stress 3>><<set _lin.festivalYear to _yearNow>><</if>><</if>>
岗棚外的防风灯在湿石板上投下长影，远处的更声穿过夜雾悠悠传来。<br><br>
<<getouticon>>
<<if _res is "fail">>
<<link [[收起冷盆 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin Festival Missed]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[独看冷透的炭灰 (0:04)|MP NPC Lin Festival Missed]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link [[随他收起火盆 (0:06)|MP NPC Lin Festival After]]>><<pass 6>><<tiredness 1>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[先回守夜岗棚复命 (0:04)|MP NPC Lin Date More Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Lin Festival After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20 }>><</if>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<set _res to (_lin.festivalResult or "partial")>>
火盆节过后的清晨，石桥栏杆上还留着一圈温热的炭灰印。<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>把生铁盆刷净收回岗棚角落，将老霍克的旧铜牌重新挂回值班簿旁。<<if _res is "success">>街坊们顺手在岗棚窗台放了热饼，他看你的眼神比平日更笃定。<<set _lin.love to Math.min(100, (_lin.love or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>><<elseif _res is "partial">>他把剩下的半袋木炭封好，说明年多备一块挡风铁板就稳了。<<stress -1>><<else>>他默默擦净受潮的铜牌，说只要人还在街上巡着，明年总能把火重旺起来。<<stress 1>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回同行目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[帮他把铁盆收好 (0:08)|MP NPC Lin More2 Hub]]>><<pass 8>><<stress -1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Lin Festival Missed [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20 }>><</if>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
桥头火盆节那晚雪势太急。<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>在风雪里守着半盆冷炭站到换班，大衣肩头积了厚厚一层白霜。次日你路过岗棚时，他正低头把冻裂的炭渣扫进铁簸箕，见你来了也只是拍拍灰，说冬夜路滑，人平安比什么都强。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回同行目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[约好明年来守火 (0:06)|MP NPC Lin More2 Hub]]>><<pass 6>><<stress -1>><</link>>
